<title>FINLAND: FISKARS SHARES RISE ON GOOD H1 RESULT.</title>
<headline>FISKARS SHARES RISE ON GOOD H1 RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish consumer goods maker Fiskars rose on Monday in relatively lively trade on the group's better-than-expected H1 results, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 1300/1000 GMT, Fiskars traded at 300.00 markka, up 10.00 markka or 3.45 percent. It earlier hit a new year-high 310.00 markka. The volume was little over three million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;The market is pleased with the good result,&quot; one broker said. &quot;But it is a quiet day, Fiskars will probably stay at this level,&quot; another said.</p>
<p>- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 292</p>
</text>
